    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always fascinated me—it’s both a precise science and an abstract art. As someone who enjoyed philosophy and computer science in my youth, I found its logical structure satisfying but challenging. It’s not just numbers; it’s the way problems reveal hidden patterns. Though I’m not deeply technical, I appreciate how math underpins everything from technology to daily life.",
